{"id":"d4aaea13d19cf090","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-satisfaction.md","title":"Term Evaluation and Satisfaction","display":"df-satisfaction — Term Evaluation and Satisfaction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-satisfaction","aliases":["90-df-satisfaction"],"display":"df-satisfaction — Term Evaluation and Satisfaction","depends_on":["[[90-df-structure]]","[[90-df-base-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfaction — Term Evaluation and Satisfaction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"264cfff82242245c\" href=\"?note=264cfff82242245c\" title=\"90-df-structure\">90-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b24fa26209f44674\" href=\"?note=b24fa26209f44674\" title=\"90-df-base-free-variable\">90-df-base-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Lambda(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_\\Lambda(\\mathcal M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(A=\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\to A\">\\(\\rho:\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\to A\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho[x\\mapsto a]\">\\(\\rho[x\\mapsto a]\\)</span> 是只更新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的赋值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C\">\\(c\\in C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F_n\">\\(f\\in F_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in R_n\">\\(R\\in R_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,t_i\">\\(s,t,t_i\\)</span> 是项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span> 是公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}\\)</span> 按有限语法树递归。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi\\)</span> 对任何公式均表示所有赋值满足；对句子这与任一赋值满足等价。第 90 本扁平签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的满足关系取其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^\\sharp\">\\(L^\\sharp\\)</span> 结构实例，不另造第二套真值约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho[x\\mapsto a]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(y,\\rho(y)):y\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\land y\\ne x\\}\\cup\\{(x,a)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}&amp;:\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\to A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(x())&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(x),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(c())\\coloneqq c^{\\mathcal M},\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1}))&amp;\\coloneqq\nf^{\\mathcal M}(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(t_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(t_{n-1})),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(s=t,\\rho)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(s)=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(R(\\vec t),\\rho)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(t_i))_{i&lt;n}\\in R^{\\mathcal M},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\neg\\varphi,\\rho)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,\\rho),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi\\land\\psi,\\rho)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,\\rho)\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\psi,\\rho),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\forall x\\varphi,\\rho)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\ \\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,\\rho[x\\mapsto a]),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,\\rho\\models\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,\\rho),\\\\\n\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\rho\\in A^{\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda}\\ \\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,\\rho),\\\\\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi)=\\varnothing&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\rho\\in A^{\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda}\\\n(\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,\\rho)),\\\\\n\\mathcal M\\models T&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\in T\\ \\mathcal M\\models\\sigma\n\\quad(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho[x\\mapsto a]&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(y,\\rho(y)):y\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\land y\\ne x\\}\\cup\\{(x,a)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}&amp;:\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\to A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(x())&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(x),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(c())\\coloneqq c^{\\mathcal M},\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1}))&amp;\\coloneqq\nf^{\\mathcal M}(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(t_0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(t_{n-1})),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(s=t,\\rho)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(s)=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(R(\\vec t),\\rho)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathcal M,\\rho}(t_i))_{i&lt;n}\\in R^{\\mathcal M},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\neg\\varphi,\\rho)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,\\rho),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi\\land\\psi,\\rho)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,\\rho)\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\psi,\\rho),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\forall x\\varphi,\\rho)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\ \\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,\\rho[x\\mapsto a]),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,\\rho\\models\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,\\rho),\\\\\n\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\rho\\in A^{\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda}\\ \\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,\\rho),\\\\\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi)=\\varnothing&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\rho\\in A^{\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda}\\\n(\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,\\rho)),\\\\\n\\mathcal M\\models T&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\in T\\ \\mathcal M\\models\\sigma\n\\quad(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 满足关系在元语言定义；不由对象理论内的 Prov、Prf 或候选真理公式解释。本文件不需要先定义可证性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"264cfff82242245c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":